# WinLoop per-user blocklist — copied to blocklist.local by setup-hooks.sh.
# blocklist.local is gitignored: your real names never reach the public repo.
#
# One extended-regex (grep -iE) pattern per line. Add every real customer,
# account, prospect, and colleague name that must never be committed.
# The examples below are fictional — REPLACE them with your own:
\b(globex|initech|hooli|stark-industries)\b
jane\.doe|john\.smith
